  "description": "Whimsical Christmas Cocktail Clipart – High-Resolution Digital Clipart Bundle\nAdd festive spirit and playful humor to your holiday creations with this whimsical Christmas cocktail clipart collection. Hand-painted in rich watercolor and gouache textures, these charming illustrations showcase holiday characters lounging inside oversized martini glasses and cocktail cups: playful elves hanging from sugar-rimmed glasses, cute gingerbread people floating in drinks, tiny mice sipping festive punch, and Mrs. Claus enjoying holiday spirits garnished with candy canes, cranberries, and fresh rosemary sprigs.\n🎨 What’s Included:\n* 14 Individual High-Quality PNG Images\n* Transparent Backgrounds\n* 300 DPI High Resolution for Crisp, Clear Printing\n* Approximately 15″ x 18″ (4500 x 5400 px) Canvas Size\n* Instant Digital Download\n✨ Perfect For:\nHoliday cocktail party invitations, Christmas bar cart art, festive kitchen tea towels, humorous holiday t-shirts, party drink menus, customized glassware, holiday coaster designs, and festive sublimation printing.\n⚠️ Please Note:\n* This is a digital download; no physical product will be shipped.\n* Colors may vary slightly depending on your monitor and printer settings.\n* Preview images and mockups are for presentation purposes only.",
